  "description": "Dusty Stencil is a bold grunge stencil font inspired by vintage military markings, industrial signage, weathered packaging, and rustic typography. Featuring authentic distressed textures and strong stencil-cut letterforms, this typeface delivers a rugged, worn appearance that adds character and impact to any design.\nPerfect for branding, posters, apparel designs, packaging, logos, labels, merchandise, vintage projects, outdoor themes, military-inspired artwork, and retro advertising. The rough texture creates a realistic aged effect while maintaining excellent readability.\nWhether you’re creating western-style graphics, industrial branding, workshop signage, or distressed typography projects, Dusty Stencil provides a powerful and authentic look.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Dusty Stencil is a bold grunge stencil font inspired by vintage military markings, industrial signage, weathered packaging, and rustic typography. Featuring authentic distressed textures and strong stencil-cut letterforms, this typeface delivers a rugged, worn appearance that adds character and impact to any design.</p>\n<p>Perfect for branding, posters, apparel designs, packaging, logos, labels, merchandise, vintage projects, outdoor themes, military-inspired artwork, and retro advertising. The rough texture creates a realistic aged effect while maintaining excellent readability.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating western-style graphics, industrial branding, workshop signage, or distressed typography projects, Dusty Stencil provides a powerful and authentic look.</p>",
